        "title": {
          "en": "AWS S3 Storage Prices Unchanged for a Decade",
          "zh": "亚马逊S3存储价格十年未变"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Amazon S3 object storage has not experienced a price reduction in ten years, despite previous regular drops.",
          "zh": "亚马逊S3对象存储价格十年未曾下调，此前价格曾定期下降。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Amazon S3's per-GB-month price was $0.150 in March 2006.",
            "The last recorded price drop for S3 was on February 1, 2014, when the price was $0.095/GB-month.",
            "Prior to 2014, S3 prices decreased several times between 2006 and 2012."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "亚马逊S3每GB每月价格在2006年3月为0.150美元。",
            "S3最后一次记录的价格下调发生在2014年2月1日，当时价格为每GB每月0.095美元。",
            "2014年之前，S3价格在2006年至2012年间曾多次下降。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "Stable S3 pricing over a decade indicates a potential stabilization of cloud storage costs, which can affect long-term planning and operational expenses for data-intensive AI applications.",
          "zh": "S3价格十年稳定可能预示着云存储成本的趋稳，这可能影响数据密集型AI应用的长期规划和运营开支。"
        },
        "source": "Simon Willison",
        "link": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/27/hn-49871741/"
      },
